    Find the previous script(s), config and run log, which I believe is an Excel workbook (.xlsx/.xlsm/.csv). Look in every user profile, Documents, Desktop, Downloads, OneDrive, C:\Scripts, and Task Scheduler. Search for *.ps1, *.py, *.bat, *.xlsx, *.csv, *.log, *.json, *.env that mention "soundcloud", and Excel files modified in the last couple of years. If something needs admin rights, tell me.
